From 4db0b15c34c1568ddb4c0d58366aff77489ddc03 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hugo223 <slimstalker@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 02:01:52 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno: Add support for Adreno 710 and 720

Add device info entries for two A7XX Gen1 low-end parts:

- FD710 (0x07010000, SD 6 Gen1 / 7s Gen2, 512 KiB GMEM, 1 CCU)
- FD720 (0x43020000, SD 7 Gen3, 1 MiB GMEM, 2 CCU)

Both use a7xx_base + a7xx_gen1, matching their A730-derived Gen1 family
(no concurrent binning/LPAC class features).

Raw regs were captured from downstream blob command streams via .rd
traces decoded with cffdump. RB magic matches a730, so a730_magic_regs
is reused; only raw_magic_regs are new.

GMEM/hbb from downstream KGSL:
 - 710=gen7_3_0 (chipid 0x07010000, LineageOS parrot/SM7435): 512K, hbb=15,
   snapshot shader_blocks num_sps=1;
 - 720=crow/SM7550 DT gen7_14_0 (qcom,adreno-gpu-gen7-14-0, OnePlus Nord CE4):
   1M, hbb=15, num_sps=2.

Also add drm-shim entries for shader testing and drm-shim.py aliases.

Signed-off-by: Hugo223 <slimstalker@gmail.com>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/44466>
[Bruno: backported to 26.2, freedreno_devices.py only, with 26.2's
 context; the drm-shim parts are left out]
---
--- a/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
+++ b/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
@@ -992,6 +992,147 @@
         [A6XXRegs.REG_A6XX_UCHE_UNKNOWN_0E12, 0],
     ]
 
